  message: "P4 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 9ae4abe13f; owner-requested re-check of open P4 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p4_review_11012026/ctrl1/). VERDICT: CURRENT. P4 review 2026-11-01 at dev 9ae4abe13f (core 9.2.0): the rename shipped in 7.0.0 (CHANGELOG), and ADR-0042:39 says the aliases are removed in the following minor release. 8.0.0, 8.1.0, 9.0.0, 9.1.0 and 9.2.0 have shipped since, so the 'gated until next minor bump' condition was met long ago. All four shims are live: `hypergumbo run` warns on stderr; `symbols --input bm.json` loads with a deprecation warning; importing behavior_map_io raises DeprecationWarning; cli.run_behavior_map is run_survey (cli.py:13721). Scope addition: production caller sketch.py:6398-6400 still imports run_behavior_map and must be repointed first. MECHANISM: deprecation-window shims retained past the window ADR-0042 set (one minor version after 7.0.0)."  # 8ad1
